{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_87", "type": "agent_message", "text": "The group saved and reopened with its date, two times, and Night owl mode intact; weekly/daily switching restored the daily entries, and discarding an edit preserved the saved schedule. The medicine list shows only the populated Estradiol heading. I reproduced one input issue in the medicine editor: saving a zero tablet strength leaves the sheet open without explaining why. I’m filing that report and will continue through the journal."}}
